+.. _api.webapp2:
+
+webapp2
+=======
+.. module:: webapp2
+
+- WSGI app
+
+  - :class:`WSGIApplication`
+  - :class:`RequestContext`
+
+- URI routing
+
+  - :class:`Router`
+  - :class:`BaseRoute`
+  - :class:`SimpleRoute`
+  - :class:`Route`
+
+- Configuration
+
+  - :class:`Config`
+
